[{"text":"FCPartialFractionForm[n, {{f1,x-r1,p1},{f2,x-r2,p2}, ...}, x] is a special way of representing sums of rational functions of x given by \\(n + \\frac{f_1}{[x-r_1]^p_1} + \\frac{f_2}{[x-r_2]^p_2} + \\ldots\\)","anchor":"fcpartialfractionform"},{"text":"It is inspired by the parfracform from Maple and its usage in E. Panzer’s HyperInt for the integration of multiple polylogarithms.","anchor":"fcpartialfractionform"},{"text":"Use ToFCPartialFractionForm to convert the given expression to this notation and FromFCPartialFractionForm to return back to the usual representation.","anchor":"fcpartialfractionform"},{"text":"Overview, ToFCPartialFractionForm, FromFCPartialFractionForm.","anchor":"see-also","section":"See also"},{"text":"Apart[c + x^2/(x - 1), x]","anchor":"cb1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[c+x+\\frac{1}{x-1}+1\\]","anchor":"cb1-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"ex1 = ToFCPartialFractionForm[c + x^2/(x - 1), x]","anchor":"cb2","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\text{FCPartialFractionForm}\\left(c+x+1,\\left( \\begin{array}{cc} \\{x-1,-1\\} & 1 \\\\ \\end{array} \\right),x\\right)","anchor":"cb2-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"FromFCPartialFractionForm[ex1]","anchor":"cb3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[c+x+\\frac{1}{x-1}+1\\]","anchor":"cb3-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"ex2 = ToFCPartialFractionForm[(-64*(-1 + z^2))/(15*(1 + z^2 + z^4)), z]","anchor":"cb4","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\text{FCPartialFractionForm}\\left(0,\\left( \\begin{array}{cc} \\left\\{z-\\sqrt[3]{-1},-1\\right\\} & -\\frac{32}{15} \\\\ \\left\\{z+\\sqrt[3]{-1},-1\\right\\} & \\frac{32}{15} \\\\ \\left\\{z-(-1)^{2/3},-1\\right\\} & \\frac{32}{15} \\\\ \\left\\{z+(-1)^{2/3},-1\\right\\} & -\\frac{32}{15} \\\\ \\end{array} \\right),z\\right)\\]","anchor":"cb4-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"FromFCPartialFractionForm[ex2]","anchor":"cb5","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\frac{32}{15 \\left(z+\\sqrt[3]{-1}\\right)}+\\frac{32}{15 \\left(z-(-1)^{2/3}\\right)}-\\frac{32}{15 \\left(z+(-1)^{2/3}\\right)}-\\frac{32}{15 \\left(z-\\sqrt[3]{-1}\\right)}\\]","anchor":"cb5-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"FromFCPartialFractionForm[ex2, Factoring -> Simplify]","anchor":"cb6","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[-\\frac{64 \\left(z^2-1\\right)}{15 \\left(z^4+z^2+1\\right)}\\]","anchor":"cb6-1","section":"Examples"}]